    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ărisba</span></b> , ae, or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ē</span></b> ,
		ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀρίσβη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A town in Troas</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 9,
				264</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 30, 33, §
			125</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town in the island of Lesbos</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2,
			7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 31, 39, §
		139</span></i>.</div>
